{"hw":"Ὀλυμπίασι","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">Ὀλυμπίασι</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">Ὀλυμπ-ίασι</span>, <span class=\"lex-gram\">Adv.</span>, <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> v. Ὀλυμπία, ἡ: but <span class=\"lex-orth gk\">Ὀλυμπιάσι</span> <span class=\"gk\">[α]</span>, dat. pl. of <span class=\"gk\">Ὀλυμπιάς.</span> </div></div>"}